    {"en", "'*' is not an entity tag. Give the tag 'etag <file> -get' prints, which a path that is not there answers with.", "'*' is not an entity tag. Give the tag 'etag <file> -get' prints, which a path that is not there answers with."},
    {"en", "'-append' and '-resume' cannot be used together: one continues at the end of the destination, the other at a shared offset in it.", "'-append' and '-resume' cannot be used together: one continues at the end of the destination, the other at a shared offset in it."},
    {"en", "'-append' needs the native SFTP transport; the transfer backends cannot position a write.", "'-append' needs the native SFTP transport; the transfer backends cannot position a write."},
    {"en", "'-criteria=checksum' cannot be combined with the 'both' direction, which compares the record of the previous synchronization instead of the files; synchronize 'local' or 'remote' to compare contents.", "'-criteria=checksum' cannot be combined with the 'both' direction, which compares the record of the previous synchronization instead of the files; synchronize 'local' or 'remote' to compare contents."},
    {"en", "'-criteria=none' cannot be combined with the 'both' direction: with nothing compared there is no way to tell which side changed.", "'-criteria=none' cannot be combined with the 'both' direction: with nothing compared there is no way to tell which side changed."},
    {"en", "'-latest' cannot be combined with '-versionid': one names the newest object, the other one exact version.", "'-latest' cannot be combined with '-versionid': one names the newest object, the other one exact version."},
    {"en", "'-mirror' cannot be combined with the 'both' direction.", "'-mirror' cannot be combined with the 'both' direction."},
    {"en", "'-rawsettings={count}' was given, but only {taken} setting parameter(s) follow.", "'-rawsettings={count}' was given, but only {taken} setting parameter(s) follow."},
    {"en", "'-rawtransfersettings={count}' was given, but only {taken} setting parameter(s) follow.", "'-rawtransfersettings={count}' was given, but only {taken} setting parameter(s) follow."},
    {"en", "'-set' takes NAME=VALUE.", "'-set' takes NAME=VALUE."},
    {"en", "'-versionid' cannot be combined with '-delete' or '-append'.", "'-versionid' cannot be combined with '-delete' or '-append'."},
    {"en", "'-versionid' is available only for S3 downloads.", "'-versionid' is available only for S3 downloads."},
    {"en", "'-versionid' is available only for S3 object versions.", "'-versionid' is available only for S3 object versions."},
    {"en", "'-versionid' needs one exact S3 object path and one optional local destination; wildcards and multiple sources are not supported.", "'-versionid' needs one exact S3 object path and one optional local destination; wildcards and multiple sources are not supported."},
    {"en", "'-versionid' needs one exact S3 object path; '-onlyfile', wildcards and multiple paths are not supported.", "'-versionid' needs one exact S3 object path; '-onlyfile', wildcards and multiple paths are not supported."},
    {"en", "'{mode}' is not a valid mode: {reason}. Use an octal number such as 644 or an expression such as u+x.", "'{mode}' is not a valid mode: {reason}. Use an octal number such as 644 or an expression such as u+x."},
