    {"en", "checksum <algorithm> <file>\n  Calculates a checksum (sha-256, sha-1, md5 or crc32) of a\n  remote file, on the server when it can, locally otherwise.", "checksum <algorithm> <file>\n  Calculates a checksum (sha-256, sha-1, md5 or crc32) of a\n  remote file, on the server when it can, locally otherwise."},
    {"en", "chmod <mode> <file> [ <file>... ] [ -recursive ]\n  Changes permissions of remote files. <mode> is octal\n  (644, 0700) or symbolic (u+x, go-w, a=r,go-w, u+s); with\n  -recursive everything below a directory is changed too,\n  symbolic links excepted.", "chmod <mode> <file> [ <file>... ] [ -recursive ]\n  Changes permissions of remote files. <mode> is octal\n  (644, 0700) or symbolic (u+x, go-w, a=r,go-w, u+s); with\n  -recursive everything below a directory is changed too,\n  symbolic links excepted."},
    {"en", "close [ <index> ]\n  Closes the open session, or the session at the 1-based\n  <index> (only one connection is open at a time).", "close [ <index> ]\n  Closes the open session, or the session at the 1-based\n  <index> (only one connection is open at a time)."},
