    {"en", "rm [ -onlyfile ] [ -versionid=ID ] <file> [ <file>... ]\n  Deletes remote files (masks allowed); -onlyfile skips\n  directories. On S3, -versionid deletes just that version\n  (including a delete marker) instead of the current object.", "rm [ -onlyfile ] [ -versionid=ID ] <file> [ <file>... ]\n  Deletes remote files (masks allowed); -onlyfile skips\n  directories. On S3, -versionid deletes just that version\n  (including a delete marker) instead of the current object."},
